            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "T%@": {},
    "Taken from your Google account. Airadar uses it only to recognise which imported flights are yours and to let friends recognise you — never to analyse your trips. Skip it if you will not use those features.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取自你的 Google 账户。Airadar 仅用它来识别哪些导入的航班属于你，以及让好友认出你 — 绝不会用于分析你的行程。如果不使用这些功能，可以跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ten flights and counting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "十个航班，还在继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "航站楼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 号航站楼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "航站楼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the Recycle Bin for %lld days, so this can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们会在回收站保留 %lld 天，因此可以撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This flight number runs more than once around this date — which one is yours?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个航班号在该日期前后有多个班次 — 你乘坐的是哪一个？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This may not be your trip — the ticket names someone else": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这可能不是你的行程 — 机票上是其他人的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Times (local at each airport)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间（各机场当地时间）"
          }
        }
